{"id":"spiegel","lemma":"Spiegel","pos":"noun","rank":1600,"glosses":["mirror (smooth surface, usually made of glass with reflective material painted on the underside, that reflects light)","level (of a liquid within a delimited space or a substance in a liquid mixture)","surface (flat overside or up-side of a liquid)"],"ipa":"/ˈʃpiːɡl̩/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/1/18/De-Spiegel.ogg/De-Spiegel.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"Spiegels","plural":"Spiegel"},"formAudio":{"Spiegels":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/8a/LL-Q188_%28deu%29-Sebastian_Wallroth-Spiegels.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Wo ist ein Spiegel?","en":"Where's a mirror?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/96845","words":[{"g":"where"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Ich kann mich im Spiegel sehen.","en":"I can see myself in the mirror.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},{"g":"me","l":"ich"},{"g":"in the"},null,{"g":"to see"}]},{"text":"Sie stand vor dem Spiegel.","en":"She stood in front of the mirror.","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"to stand","l":"stehen"},{"g":"in front of, ahead of"},{"g":"(to) the","l":"der"},null]},{"text":"Siehst du gerne in den Spiegel?","en":"Do you like looking in the mirror?","words":[{"g":"to see","l":"sehen"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"don't mention it"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"the","l":"der"},null]},{"text":"Mach den Spiegel sauber!","en":"Clean the mirror.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/44286","words":[{"g":"to make","l":"machen"},{"g":"the","l":"der"},null,{"g":"clean"}]}]}